Implemented and validated the core fix. Ticket [44119807](.ticket/tickets/44119807-53af-41b0-920a-ffbc985d425d/ticket.toml) moved to `in-review`.

## Files changed

- [memory-api/crates/session-api/src/tool_metrics.rs](memory-api/crates/session-api/src/tool_metrics.rs#L244-L495) — replaced first-wins `BTreeSet` dedup with rank-aware `TrackedToolCall` upgrade logic; added `output_source_rank` and `TrackedToolCall`.
- [memory-api/crates/session-api/src/store/config/capture_query.rs](memory-api/crates/session-api/src/store/config/capture_query.rs#L63-L82) — removed `MAX_ATTEMPTS` × `RETRY_DELAY` blocking loop; now single-parse/persist.
